WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:05.900
Hey y'all, we are open today from 3 to 8 PM,
as stated in the post.

00:05.900 --> 00:08.900
We do not have cookies this weekend,
but we do have loaf cakes.

00:08.900 --> 00:11.500
So here's the strawberry one.

00:11.500 --> 00:14.700
It's a strawberry cake with buttercream frosting,
with our strawberry crunch.

00:15.200 --> 00:17.500
We have the banana pudding one.

00:17.500 --> 00:20.800
It has our buttercream frosting
with a banana flavored cake,

00:20.800 --> 00:24.100
and then you also have banana pudding
on the top, with a vanilla wafer.

00:24.700 --> 00:28.000
We have our Oreo one,
which is an Oreo cake with our Oreo buttercream,

00:28.000 --> 00:31.600
with Oreo crumbles all on the top.

00:32.300 --> 00:34.900
Then we have our Biscoff cookie butter one.

00:34.900 --> 00:38.200
This is a cookie butter Biscoff flavored cake,

00:38.200 --> 00:41.600
with cookie butter spread on the top
with some buttercream frosting.

00:41.600 --> 00:43.600
And then we have our red velvet.

00:44.100 --> 00:47.500
Okay, you already know about the red velvet.
Y'all come get this by Jay.

00:47.500 --> 00:50.500
We do have these cakes this weekend.

00:50.500 --> 00:53.400
We have all of the cups, all of the slices,
and then we have these cakes.
